+    # `heavy` is false only for a pull request whose every file is on the inert list below (docs that no test,
+    # script or guard reads). The heavy jobs then skip and `required` accepts that. Any doubt (API error, a push,
+    # 3000 files or more, one file off the list) leaves heavy true. docs/ops/proposed/ci-speed.md, change 2.
+    outputs:
